{"text":"I opened my bag, put my hand inside my bag, brought out my money that I had earned from doing my work, and I gave it to the man. And he, this man who was very grateful and very happy, took the money from me, looked across at Louis and said, why is he thanking me? I didn't give him the money. Then I saw realization dawn on Louis' face. The man believed that whatever money I had had ultimately came, had ultimately come from Louis, because Louis is a man. Now men and women are different. We have different hormones, we have different sexual organs, we have different biological abilities. Women can have babies, men can't.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.58},{"text":"opened","start":0.58,"end":1.14},{"text":"my","start":1.14,"end":1.38},{"text":"bag","start":1.38,"end":1.74,"punct":","},{"text":"put","start":2.24,"end":2.38},{"text":"my","start":2.38,"end":2.54},{"text":"hand","start":2.54,"end":2.7},{"text":"inside","start":2.7,"end":3.04},{"text":"my","start":3.04,"end":3.26},{"text":"bag","start":3.26,"end":3.6,"punct":","},{"text":"brought","start":3.7,"end":3.84},{"text":"out","start":3.84,"end":4.02},{"text":"my","start":4.02,"end":4.2},{"text":"money","start":4.2,"end":4.5},{"text":"that","start":4.5,"end":4.74},{"text":"I","start":4.74,"end":4.88},{"text":"had","start":4.88,"end":5.0},{"text":"earned","start":5.0,"end":5.2},{"text":"from","start":5.2,"end":5.38},{"text":"doing","start":5.38,"end":5.58},{"text":"my","start":5.58,"end":5.78},{"text":"work","start":5.78,"end":6.1,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":6.7,"end":7.42},{"text":"I","start":7.42,"end":7.52},{"text":"gave","start":7.52,"end":7.66},{"text":"it","start":7.66,"end":7.8},{"text":"to","start":7.8,"end":7.92},{"text":"the","start":7.92,"end":8.04},{"text":"man","start":8.04,"end":8.28,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":9.72,"end":9.84},{"text":"he","start":9.84,"end":10.18,"punct":","},{"text":"this","start":10.44,"end":10.54},{"text":"man","start":10.54,"end":10.8},{"text":"who"